[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4800.55, "timestamp": "01:20:00", "text": "在此之前，100 才是第一位的。所以我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4803.11, "timestamp": "01:20:03", "text": "点击这个编辑按钮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4804.99, "timestamp": "01:20:04", "text": "我这就把它拖到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4807.99, "timestamp": "01:20:07", "text": "底部。因此，用户选择的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4809.95, "timestamp": "01:20:09", "text": "向下滚动，结果是 0"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4812.709, "timestamp": "01:20:12", "text": "2550. 现在让我们拿出其中一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4814.47, "timestamp": "01:20:14", "text": "从资产面板中。现在我们可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4815.83, "timestamp": "01:20:15", "text": "你看，我们有下拉菜单，就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4817.669, "timestamp": "01:20:17", "text": "之前，它让我们在两者之间移动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4819.51, "timestamp": "01:20:19", "text": "不同的进步阶段。但是我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4821.75, "timestamp": "01:20:21", "text": "还可以切换显示是否存在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4824.47, "timestamp": "01:20:24", "text": "是否有文字？所以切换"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4826.229, "timestamp": "01:20:26", "text": "基本上是从这个切换到这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4827.83, "timestamp": "01:20:27", "text": "本案中就有一个。现在，我们有以下原因："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4829.669, "timestamp": "01:20:29", "text": "之所以使用切换开关而不是下拉菜单，是因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4832.63, "timestamp": "01:20:32", "text": "我们使用了真值和假值。它还"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4835.03, "timestamp": "01:20:35", "text": "适用于开/关和是/否。你会看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4837.11, "timestamp": "01:20:37", "text": "如果我把它改成别的呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4841.39, "timestamp": "01:20:41", "text": "假设……嗯……没有短信"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4844.709, "timestamp": "01:20:44", "text": "并附有文字。所以我要改变"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4847.35, "timestamp": "01:20:47", "text": "如果选择值，则会显示下拉菜单。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4850.709, "timestamp": "01:20:50", "text": "是的。所以这取决于你拥有什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4853.59, "timestamp": "01:20:53", "text": "你需要什么。但我真的很喜欢用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4856.39, "timestamp": "01:20:56", "text": "但我真的很喜欢用“嗯，是”和“否”之类的词。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4857.91, "timestamp": "01:20:57", "text": "对错之分，因为它就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4859.51, "timestamp": "01:20:59", "text": "切换功能用起来更有趣，而且"}]